# CIC Dataset Analysis

Comparative analysis of CIC-based network intrusion detection datasets for evaluating their sustainability for a machine-learning IDS project.

## Current Scope

Currently analyzing:

- CIC-IDS2017

Planned:

- CSE-CIC-IDS2017
- CIC-DDoS2019

## Current Progress

- [x] Environment setup
- [x] CIC-IDS2017 Monday EDA
- [x] CIC-IDS2017 Tuesday EDA
- [ ] Missing value analysis
- [ ] Duplicates analysis
- [ ] Infinite-value analysis
- [ ] Automated dataset profiling
- [ ] Full CIC-IDS2017 analysis
- [ ] CIC-IDS2018 analysis
- [ ] CIC-DDoS2019 analysis
- [ ] Cross-dataset comparison
- [ ] Power BI dashboard
- [ ] ML suitability evaluation

